  "content": "<span>\n<center>  \n\n![Mythic Metals](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/logo-banner.png)\n\n<section>\nMythic Metals 是一個 Minecraft 模組，專注於尋找新礦物、將其冶煉成錠和合金，然後打造成你最喜愛的工具和盔甲。\n\n</section>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<section>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/ores-and-metals-banner.png\" alt=\"礦物與金屬\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\">\n\n這個模組中的礦物各自分布在地底的不同區域。有些甚至存在於地獄和終界！\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/cave-screenshot.png\" alt=\"亞當曼提特、祕銀、四重鈾、銀礦圖片\" width=\"1000\" height=\"700\">\n\n收集足夠的礦物後，你可以透過冶煉、高爐提煉，或使用合金鍛造爐，將它們打造成精美的金屬或獨特的合金。\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/alloy-forgery.png\" alt=\"深板岩合金鍛造爐及其介面\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\">\n</section>\n<br>  \n<br>  \n\n<section>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/tools-and-armor-banner.png\" alt=\"工具與盔甲\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\">   \n\n比獄髓更強的劍、能鑿穿黑曜石牆的鎬，以及會隨著時間成長的盔甲。這些都是你可以利用這些金屬找到並製作出來的裝備。\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/legendary-banglum-screenshot.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"273\" alt=\"一名玩家使用傳奇邦格鎬在牆壁上開鑿\">  \n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/armor-screenshot.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" alt=\"一名玩家手持聖劍，身穿完整普羅米修斯盔甲\">\n</section>\n\n<section>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals#credits\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/credits-banner.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" alt=\"致謝\" >\n</a>\n\n這個專案若沒有眾多人的協助是無法實現的。感謝每一位貢獻者！點擊上方橫幅可查看完整的致謝名單。\n\n</section>\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/69cKvQWScC \">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Noaaan/MythicMetals/refs/heads/1.21.4/images/discord-banner.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"93\" alt=\"Wraith Coding Session 的 Discord 橫幅\">\n</a>\n</center> \n</span>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
